              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho abakulu ab'enda edh'Abalevi baidha aghali Eleazari kabona, ni Yoshua mutabane wa Nuni, n'abakulu ab'ebika byonabyona eby'Abaisiraeli, ",
          "type": "text",
